        <mxCell id="2" value="# Sequence Diagram - Employee Management

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant HR as HR User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant API as Spring Boot API
    participant Service as EmployeService
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Note over HR,DB: Employee CRUD Operations

    %% Create Employee
    HR-&gt;&gt;Frontend: Fill employee form
    Frontend-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/employes
    API-&gt;&gt;Service: createEmploye(employeDto)
    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT new employee
    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: Return saved employee
    Service--&gt;&gt;API: Return employee data
    API--&gt;&gt;Frontend: Return success response
    Frontend--&gt;&gt;HR: Show success notification

    %% Read Employees
    HR-&gt;&gt;Frontend: View employee list
    Frontend-&gt;&gt;API: GET /api/employes
    API-&gt;&gt;Service: getAllEmployes()
    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT all employees
    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: Return employee list
    Service--&gt;&gt;API: Return employee list
    API--&gt;&gt;Frontend: Return employee data
    Frontend--&gt;&gt;HR: Display employee table

    %% Update Employee
    HR-&gt;&gt;Frontend: Edit employee
    Frontend-&gt;&gt;API: PUT /api/employes/{id}
    API-&gt;&gt;Service: updateEmploye(id, employeDto)
    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE employee
    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: Return updated employee
    Service--&gt;&gt;API: Return employee data
    API--&gt;&gt;Frontend: Return success response
    Frontend--&gt;&gt;HR: Show success notification

    %% Delete Employee
    HR-&gt;&gt;Frontend: Delete employee
    Frontend-&gt;&gt;API: DELETE /api/employes/{id}
    API-&gt;&gt;Service: deleteEmploye(id)
    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: DELETE employee
    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: Confirm deletion
    Service--&gt;&gt;API: Return success
    API--&gt;&gt;Frontend: Return success response
    Frontend--&gt;&gt;HR: Show success notification
```" style="shape=mxgraph.mermaid;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
